  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Sleeping Arrangements<br>Two Story Home<br>1st Floor | Master 1, King Bed<br>2nd Floor | Guest 1, Twin over Twin Bunk Bed and Twin over Full Bunk Bed; Guest 2, Queen Bed; Guest 3, Queen Bed; Guest 4, King Bed<br><br>Parking: This property provides two driveway parking spots, offering guests direct access to the unit.<br><br>Discover the epitome of luxury and location at Villa Lago within the esteemed SANDESTIN GOLF AND BEACH RESORT®. Home1875 is a true gem, perfectly positioned on the 6th Tee Box of the Baytowne Golf Course, offering not only a golf-front view but also a uniquely expansive backyard setting, making it a standout in the Villa Lago community, a gorgeous neighborhood best explored with this home’s two included golf carts.<br><br>This two-story Mediterranean-style home boasts extensive patio and driveway enlargements, providing ample outdoor seating and dining options ideal for large gatherings. Here, you can enjoy spectacular fireworks displays from Baytowne Wharf right in your own backyard during the summer season.<br><br>This luxurious abode features five bedrooms and 4.5 baths, accommodating up to 13 guests comfortably, making it an excellent choice for large families or groups of friends aiming to create unforgettable memories on the Gulf. On the first floor, the main living space unfolds in an open concept design, where a well-equipped updated kitchen with brand new stainless steel appliances, and a breakfast bar invites you to prepare delightful meals. Whether you choose to dine at the kitchen's own space or at the 6-person dining table, every meal becomes a moment to cherish.<br><br>The first-floor master suite offers a sanctuary with a king bed, SMART TV, and a spa-like en suite bathroom featuring a tiled shower designed for relaxation. Upstairs, four additional bedrooms each with SMART TVs, three full baths, and a private balcony complete the private quarters. <br>Convenience is key with a hall laundry room on the first floor, easing the chore of managing beachwear.<br><br>With the addition of two personal golf carts, freedom is just a ride away. Cruise to the community pool, adorned with loungers and lattice coverings, or journey down to the private beach access of Sandestin Resort, where the sugar-white sands of Miramar Beach await. <br><br>Guest Walk-Through<br>Two Story House<br>1st Floor – Kitchen, Dining Room, Living Room, 1 Bedroom 1.5 Baths, Laundry Room, Screened Porch, Back Paver Patio<br>2nd Floor – 4 Bedrooms, 3 Full Baths, Balcony<br><br>Unit Amenities- 2 Golf Carts (4-Seat & 6-Seat), Screened Back Porch, Back Patio, Grill, Laundry, Driveway Parking for 2 Cars<br>Community Amenities- Community Pool<br>Resort Amenities- Gated Community, Multiple Pools, Resort Tram, Fitness Center/Spa/Salon, Golf, Tennis, Marina, Shops, Restaurants, Entertainment, Private Beach, Watersports<br><br>About the Community of Villa Lago<br>Villa Lago is the latest addition to the Resort offering single family 3-, 4- and 5-bedroom homes with Mediterranean-style and resort comforts. Enjoy amenities such as the community pool and the first-class dining and entertainment options of the Village of Baytowne Wharf. Most properties have either a lake or golf course view. Amenities such as golf, tennis, biking, boating, water sports & more are available locally at additional costs.<br><br>Local Favorites<br>MVH guests receive savings with our Local Favorites. Enjoy discounts to restaurants, beach activities, and shopping so you can save while you stay.<br><br>MVH Beach Closet<br>This property offers a Beach Closet stocked with complimentary beach chairs and an umbrella for use during your stay.<br><br>MVH Rental Restrictions<br>Please reference the Rental Restrictions and Terms of Use.<br><br>SANDESTIN® is a federally registered trademark owned by Sandestin Investments, LLC (“SI”). My Vacation Haven, LLC is an independent entity and is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or associated with SI. Any use or reference to SI or its trademarks is solely to identify a property and not to suggest any affiliation with SI.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
